      "title": "Sticky salmon fillet in a ginger soy glaze",
      "content_html": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;\">Sticky salmon fillet in a ginger soy glaze</h1>\n        <br>\n        <img src=\"https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/sticky-salmon-fillet-in-a-ginger-soy-glaze.webp\" style=\"text-align:center;\"/>\n        <br>\n        <p style=\"font-family:sans-serif;>When it comes to food, I\u2019m a huge fan of anything with \u2018sticky\u2019 in the title and I wanted to create that wonderful quality here, but in a slightly more subtle way, so that it could be enjoyed with a delicately flavoured ingredient like fish. This recipe combines my love for sticky sauce with wonderful salmon; hopefully you enjoy the combination as much as I do.</p>",
      "image": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/sticky-salmon-fillet-in-a-ginger-soy-glaze.webp",
      "date_published": "2026-10-13T00:00:00+00:00Z",
      "language": "en"
    },
