      "id": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/potato-rosti-with-smoked-ham-and-eggs",
      "url": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/potato-rosti-with-smoked-ham-and-eggs",
      "title": "Potato r\u00f6sti with smoked ham and eggs",
      "content_html": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;\">Potato r\u00f6sti with smoked ham and eggs</h1>\n        <br>\n        <img src=\"https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/potato-rosti-with-smoked-ham-and-eggs.webp\" style=\"text-align:center;\"/>\n        <br>\n        <p style=\"font-family:sans-serif;>Just a handful of humble ingredients come together here for a joyous lunch (or even breakfast) that\u2019s far easier to make in a roasting pan than in a frying pan. As ever, keep your eyes glued to the eggs as they bake: all ovens are different and you want the yolks to spill their loveliness over the r\u00f6sti when you cut into them, not require a carving knife.</p>",
      "image": "https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/potato-rosti-with-smoked-ham-and-eggs.webp",
      "date_published": "2026-10-03T00:00:00+00:00Z",
      "language": "en"
